# Astro Component Patterns

## Frontmatter
- Order frontmatter as imports, local constants, then derived values
- Type props explicitly with `interface Props`

## Roles
- Pages live in `src/pages`
- Layouts live in `src/layouts` and render `<slot />`
- Components live in `src/components` and stay presentational

## Routing
- Use file-based static routes only for this version
- Top-level pages are `/`, `/sobre`, and `/localizacao`

